  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Builders of Africa&apos;s Future (BAF) - AIT Group&apos;s Poultry Day Old Chicks Hatchery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Poultry. The initiative will provide 2000 small and medium scale farmers have access to affordable, quality inputs (poultry Day-old Chicks) for their operations which will increase their productivity and generate more jobs. 40-70 students will perform internships at the hatchery and on poultry farms. a percentage of those trained students will be employed at the hatchery and make extra money.</narrative>
  </description>
